            "title": "{{business_name}} has a proud tradition of service",
            "paragraphs": [
              "{{business_name}} has a proud tradition of service in the construction industry. With a legacy of local and regional experience, the team focuses on delivering distinctive design-build projects with clear schedules, budgets, and communication. The approach to every project starts with understanding the owner's needs and expectations, then building a plan around those goals."
            ],
            "href": "/about",
            "link_label": "Read our story."
          },
          "source_refs": [
            {
              "url": "https://www.harperconstruction.com/",
